{
  "name": "Local B2B Website Weakness Audit, Owner Email & Cold-Pitch Outreach Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Local B2B Website Audit, Email & Cold-Pitch Pipeline (All-in-One)\n\nReads local business URLs (or US Chamber city presets) from **Google Sheets**, runs an **8-point website weakness X-ray** (SSL, mobile viewport, speed, copyright year, SEO/LocalBusiness schema, GA4/Meta/TikTok pixels, booking/chat widgets, CMS), recovers Cloudflare-decoded **owner/business emails**, generates a **0–100 Pitch Priority Score** + zero-hallucination **coldEmailSubject & coldEmailIcebreaker**, logs results to Google Sheets, and routes top VIP leads to Slack `#agency-leads` + Gmail while separating `bot_protected` sites cleanly.\n\n**Actor URL:** https://apify.com/maitreya_buddha/local-b2b-website-audit-email-pitch-finder\n**GitHub MCP & Kit:** https://github.com/wonderpick/apify-b2b-ecom-automation-kit\n**Cost:** $4.50 / 1,000 leads · **$0 for optional filtered misses** · 128–256 MB RAM · $0 proxy.",
        "height": 290,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000101",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview & Cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Prospect Source (Google Sheets -> Audit Payload)\n\nCreate a spreadsheet with three tabs:\n- **`Prospects`**: columns `websiteUrl` (optional), `presetChamber` (optional, e.g. `phoenix_az`), `chamberCategoryKeyword` (optional, e.g. `dental`), `agencyPreset` (`all`, `web_design`, `local_seo`, `paid_ads`, `ai_chatbot_booking`).\n- **`AuditedLeads`**: columns `companyName`, `websiteUrl`, `siteStatus`, `pitchTier`, `pitchPriorityScore`, `primaryEmail`, `recommendedService`, `detectedPainPoints`, `coldEmailSubject`, `coldEmailIcebreaker`, `cmsPlatform`, `phone`, `city`, `scrapedAt`.\n- **`ManualReviewWAF`**: stores `bot_protected`, `unreachable`/`http_error`, no-email, dead-MX, or zero-weakness leads cleanly without triggering false outreach.",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000102",
      "name": "Sticky Note - 1. Prospect Source",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. 8-Point X-Ray + Owner Email + Cold-Pitch Engine\n\n1. Create a free [Apify account](https://apify.com) and generate an API token (`Settings -> API & Integrations`).\n2. Create an n8n **Header Auth** credential (`Name`: `Authorization`, `Value`: `Bearer <your_apify_token>`) and attach it to **Audit Local Websites & Draft Pitches via Apify**.\n3. Strict WAF sites (`bot_protected`) are separated cleanly to `ManualReviewWAF` so your agency never sends false 'site down' emails.",
        "height": 580,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000103",
      "name": "Sticky Note - 2. Audit & Pitch Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        940,
        360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Pitch Priority Tiering, Sheet Sync & Agency Routing\n\n- **All pitch-ready leads** are appended to `AuditedLeads` in Google Sheets (ready for Instantly.ai / Smartlead / Clay).\n- **VIP_HOT** (`pitchPriorityScore >= 75`) -> Slack `#agency-leads` + Gmail ready-to-send pitch brief.\n- **WARM_PITCH** (`45–74`) & **NURTURE** -> Slack `#agency-ops`.",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000104",
      "name": "Sticky Note - 3. Pitch Tiering & Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1740,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "weeksInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Weekly Agency Audit Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Manual Audit Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Prospects",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Read Prospects from Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        420,
        610
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const rows = $input.all().map((item) => item.json || {});\nconst urlSet = new Set();\nconst presetSet = new Set();\nlet agencyPreset = 'all';\nlet chamberCategoryKeyword = '';\n\nfor (const row of rows) {\n  const u = row.websiteUrl || row.website || row.url || '';\n  if (typeof u === 'string' && u.trim()) urlSet.add(u.trim());\n  const p = row.presetChamber || row.chamber || '';\n  if (typeof p === 'string' && p.trim()) presetSet.add(p.trim());\n  if (typeof row.agencyPreset === 'string' && row.agencyPreset.trim()) agencyPreset = row.agencyPreset.trim();\n  if (!chamberCategoryKeyword && typeof row.chamberCategoryKeyword === 'string' && row.chamberCategoryKeyword.trim()) {\n    chamberCategoryKeyword = row.chamberCategoryKeyword.trim();\n  }\n}\n\nconst websiteUrls = Array.from(urlSet);\nconst presetChambers = presetSet.size > 0 ? Array.from(presetSet) : (websiteUrls.length === 0 ? ['phoenix_az'] : []);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    websiteUrls,\n    presetChambers,\n    chamberCategoryKeyword,\n    agencyPreset,\n    enableContactPageFollow: true,\n    onlyWithEmail: false,\n    maxItems: 50,\n    maxConcurrency: 3\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Build Audit Batch Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        610
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/maitreya_buddha~local-b2b-website-audit-email-pitch-finder/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "memory",
              "value": "256"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ websiteUrls: $json.websiteUrls, presetChambers: $json.presetChambers, chamberCategoryKeyword: $json.chamberCategoryKeyword, agencyPreset: $json.agencyPreset, enableContactPageFollow: $json.enableContactPageFollow, onlyWithEmail: $json.onlyWithEmail, maxItems: $json.maxItems, maxConcurrency: $json.maxConcurrency }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 240000
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Audit Local Websites & Draft Pitches via Apify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        610
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-live-status",
              "leftValue": "={{ ['ok', 'slow'].includes($json.siteStatus || '') }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-has-email",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.primaryEmail || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-mx-valid",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.emailMxValid !== false }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-has-weakness",
              "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.weaknessCount || 0) }}",
              "rightValue": 1,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-has-subject",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.coldEmailSubject || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-outreach-ready",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.outreachStatus || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "ready",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-not-cs-queue",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.inboxType || 'none' }}",
              "rightValue": "cs_ticket_queue",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-not-zb-unsafe",
              "leftValue": "={{ Boolean($json.zeroBounceUnsafe) }}",
              "rightValue": false,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-not-inbox-none",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.inboxType || 'none' }}",
              "rightValue": "none",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Not Bot-Protected?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        610
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ManualReviewWAF",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "companyName": "={{ $json.companyName }}",
            "websiteUrl": "={{ $json.websiteUrl || '' }}",
            "siteStatus": "={{ $json.siteStatus }}",
            "phone": "={{ $json.phone || '' }}",
            "city": "={{ $json.city || '' }}",
            "scrapedAt": "={{ $json.scrapedAt }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0006-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Log Bot-Protected Sites for Manual Check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1500,
        790
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst results = [];\n\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const d = item.json || {};\n  const score = Number(d.pitchPriorityScore || 0);\n  let pitchTier = 'NURTURE';\n  if (score >= 75) pitchTier = 'VIP_HOT';\n  else if (score >= 45) pitchTier = 'WARM_PITCH';\n\n  const pains = Array.isArray(d.detectedPainPoints) ? d.detectedPainPoints.join('; ') : '';\n  const slackSummary = [\n    `:rocket: *[${pitchTier}] Agency Pitch Lead:* ${d.companyName} (Score: *${score}/100*)`,\n    `*Website:* ${d.websiteUrl || 'NO WEBSITE'} (${d.siteStatus}) | *CMS:* ${d.cmsPlatform || 'N/A'}`,\n    `*Owner/Biz Email:* ${d.primaryEmail || 'No email (call/DM)'} | *Phone:* ${d.phone || 'N/A'}`,\n    `*Weaknesses:* ${pains || 'None'}`,\n    `*Recommended Pitch:* ${d.recommendedService}`,\n    `*Subject:* ${d.coldEmailSubject}`,\n    `*Icebreaker:* ${d.coldEmailIcebreaker}`\n  ].join('\\n');\n\n  results.push({\n    json: {\n      ...d,\n      pitchTier,\n      painPointsText: pains,\n      slackSummary\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nreturn results;"
      },
